        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia AP-9031P, Square Reed Appliance Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in a large selection of finish color options, the Reed Refrigerator Pull is a beautiful statement piece to finish the look of your transitional kitchen. The Square Reed Appliance Pull is available in 12 inch and 18 inch center to center lengths. Each appliance handle comes packaged with the mounting hardware to install it on an appliance panel. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia 9031P Pull is available as a <a href=\"/products/modern-reed-cabinet-pull-omnia-9031\"><b> Reed Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Omnia Ultima AP-9029P Maddox Refrigerator Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thick Appliance Panel</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>AP-9031P/305:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/4\" square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>AP-9031P/457:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/4\" square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MGR-filigree-detail.jpg?v=1704354535\" width=\"524\" height=\"121\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>",
